</div>
</header><section class="sec" id="services" aria-labelledby="s-t">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">What we do</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="s-t">Residential building - precision at every stage</h2>
  <div class="svc">
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">01</p><h3 class="svc__h">Residential building</h3><p class="svc__p">New homes constructed to exacting tolerances - from slab to final fix.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">02</p><h3 class="svc__h">Extensions</h3><p class="svc__p">Seamless additions that respect the original structure and exceed the brief.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">03</p><h3 class="svc__h">Structural work</h3><p class="svc__p">Load-bearing alterations, steel and timber framing, engineered solutions.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">04</p><h3 class="svc__h">Project management</h3><p class="svc__p">End-to-end coordination - trades, certifications, program and budget control.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">05</p><h3 class="svc__h">Renovations</h3><p class="svc__p">Whole-house and part renovations delivered to the same standard as new work.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--panel" id="approach" aria-labelledby="a-t">
  <div class="inner">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">Approach</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="a-t">Precision.<br>Quality.<br>No compromise.</h2>
  <div class="about">
    <div class="about__art rv">
      <canvas id="detailCanvas" width="560" height="300" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <p class="about__cap">// LASER GRID ALIGNMENT - structural grid to 1mm tolerance</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="about__lis">
      <li class="rv">Laser-level set-out on every job - walls, openings and services located to 1mm before a cut is made.</li>
      <li class="rv">Digital coordination: 3D model clash detection resolves structure, services and finishes before site start.</li>
      <li class="rv">Hold-point inspections baked into the programme - independent verification at each critical stage.</li>
      <li class="rv">Single-point accountability - one project lead, one schedule, one quality standard from ground-up to handover.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="capabilities" aria-labelledby="c-t">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">Capabilities</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="c-t">Technical scope - what we control in-house</h2>
  <div class="svc">
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">Concrete & formwork</p><h3 class="svc__h">Slabs, footings, suspended floors</h3><p class="svc__p">Engineered formwork, post-tension coordination, finish-grade tolerances.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">Steel fabrication</p><h3 class="svc__h">Portal frames, beams, connections</h3><p class="svc__p">CNC-detailed, workshop-fabricated, site-bolted to survey grid.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">Timber framing</p><h3 class="svc__h">Wall, floor and roof systems</h3><p class="svc__p">Machine-graded timber, pre-cut panels, laser-laid plates and studs.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">Envelope & finishes</p><h3 class="svc__h">Cladding, glazing, internal linings</h3><p class="svc__p">Weather-tight detailing, thermal bridging control, Level 5 finish option.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">Services integration</p><h3 class="svc__h">Hydraulic, electrical, mechanical</h3><p class="svc__p">Coordinated risers, slab penetrations pre-planned, commissioning verified.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv"><p class="svc__n">Certification</p><h3 class="svc__h">BCA, NCC, Australian Standards</h3><p class="svc__p">Private certifier liaison, mandatory inspections, occupation certificate pathway.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

